WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.650
- Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:03.270
I can't tell you how awesome it is

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.280
to be here in my home studio.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:08.310
Los Angeles is filled with
so many cool experiences.

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:10.230
In fact, there's a one of a kind

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:13.050
interactive installation in Santa Monica,

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:14.550
that promises to make you feel

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.650
like your absolute best self.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:18.210
I'm talking about Tyra Banks

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.970
and her new business
venture, The Posing Party

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:22.170
at ModelLand.

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:23.702
Since I can't be in two places at once

00:00:23.702 --> 00:00:26.520
I asked Danielle
Nottingham, the co-host of

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:28.320
California Live, to check it out for me.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.430
And she's there now.

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:30.499
Hi.

00:00:30.499 --> 00:00:32.424
(audience cheers)

00:00:32.424 --> 00:00:35.700
- Hi, Kelly, and welcome to ModelLand.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.670
This is an immersive, interactive show,

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:40.950
it has actors, it has models

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:43.484
and it's not just about striking a pose.

00:00:43.484 --> 00:00:46.500
You are your own muse here

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.650
and there's no place like
this anywhere, Kelly.

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:50.483
- I love it.

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:52.140
So you're supposed to
get the VIP experience

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:53.940
so you have a tour guide, right?

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:55.860
- Oh, Kelly, I don't
have just a tour guide.

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:59.070
I have the tour guide, Tyra Banks.

00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:01.208
(audience cheers)

00:01:01.208 --> 00:01:02.830
- [Kelly] What's up, Tyra?

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.960
Wait, wait, tell us more about ModelLand.

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:07.650
- Yeah, so ModelLand is a place

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:09.240
that hosts so many different themes.

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:12.210
Our first theme is, The Posing Party,

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:14.760
where anybody and everybody can come.

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:16.680
All shapes, all sizes, all ages.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.450
Families, mamas', daddies, dates.

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:20.580
Everybody can come and learn how to take

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.440
the most amazing pictures in the world.

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:27.420
If you have a camera phone,
you are your own muse.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.890
So we wanna teach you how to get

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:30.270
the right angles.

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:31.260
Teach you lighting.

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:34.170
Teach you everything, but it's a show.

00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:36.030
It's a theatrical show

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:37.350
and you are the star of the show.

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:40.230
So, you're being
entertained and enlightened,

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:41.280
at the same time.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:42.720
- And Tyra, you've been
trying to open this

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:44.430
for a couple of years?

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:45.900
- I had this idea fifteen years ago.

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:46.800
- Oh wow, fifteen.

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:47.633
- Yes.

00:01:47.633 --> 00:01:49.020
So let me break it down 'cause Kelly,

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:50.820
I know you are a dreamer, you had a dream

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:52.643
and you're living your dream now.

00:01:52.643 --> 00:01:53.476
- Yeah.

00:01:53.476 --> 00:01:55.020
- So, I had a dream to open this place.

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:59.091
I was like, immersive,
theater, retailtainment,

00:01:59.091 --> 00:02:00.300
shopping when you're
like, being entertained.

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:01.440
People were like, huh?

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:02.273
What?

00:02:02.273 --> 00:02:03.480
Fifteen years ago.

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:06.810
Then, maybe eight years
ago, I pulled that idea off

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:08.190
the shelves, pitched it again

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:11.139
and everybody's like
oh, yeah, entertainment

00:02:11.139 --> 00:02:12.419
and immersive theater,
we know what that is now.

00:02:12.419 --> 00:02:13.860
(group laughing)

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:16.050
- But now we're here, but then guess what?

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:17.880
I was going to launch it
and then guess what happened

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:19.779
to the whole world in 2020?

00:02:19.779 --> 00:02:20.612
- COVID.

00:02:20.612 --> 00:02:21.445
- COVID.

00:02:21.445 --> 00:02:23.407
So we were never able to open these doors.

00:02:23.407 --> 00:02:25.380
And finally, we are here.

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:26.970
I am so excited.

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:28.440
People have been coming and saying that

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:30.240
they've learned their angles.

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.490
Mamas', grand-mamas', everybody.

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:33.390
And it just touches my heart

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:35.190
because I've been studying poses since

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:36.771
I was fifteen years old and now

00:02:36.771 --> 00:02:39.330
I have trained this whole place

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:40.770
to teach you all.

00:02:40.770 --> 00:02:42.090
You guys will come to The Posing Party

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:44.880
and walk out divas and devos.

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:45.713
- It's magical.

00:02:45.713 --> 00:02:46.860
It really is, magical.

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:47.693
- Thank you.

00:02:47.693 --> 00:02:49.980
- I love it, wait, I love
that you had this dream

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:51.690
so long ago too and you stuck with it.

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:52.620
That's cool.

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:55.170
So can you give us a little taste

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:57.630
of the ModelLand experience?

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:02.264
- Oh, yes, so often when people
are wanting to take a photo.

00:03:02.264 --> 00:03:04.350
When to try to fit in, what do we do?

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:05.460
We go, uh.

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.293
- Or like this.

00:03:06.293 --> 00:03:07.410
- Trying to fit in, yes.

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:08.970
But what you don't realize is you have

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:12.435
to booty back, chest downwards.

00:03:12.435 --> 00:03:13.770
- Booty back, chest?

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:14.700
- Yes, just a little bit.

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:16.890
Not too much, not too much.

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:18.390
- Why did nobody tell me this till' now?

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:19.223
- Chest downwards.

00:03:19.223 --> 00:03:21.630
Yes and this is actually very flattering.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:22.890
Particularly, if you have on a blazer.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:23.898
Like see, if I'm like this.

00:03:23.898 --> 00:03:24.731
(group laughing)

00:03:24.731 --> 00:03:26.760
But if I go like this, do
you see the difference?

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:27.933
- Oh, okay, like this.

00:03:27.933 --> 00:03:29.040
- This and like this.

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:31.050
It's booty back, chest forward.

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:32.820
Little things like that
you're going to learn here.

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:34.500
And that's just a little
tip of the iceberg honey,.

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:35.967
you got to come to The Posing Party.

00:03:35.967 --> 00:03:38.190
- I'm just a little upset over here

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:40.050
'cause I'm forty years old

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:41.130
just now learning that trick.

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:42.780
I got such a big ole behind.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:43.890
I was like, wait, what?

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.230
Now you're going to see me in every photo.

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:48.245
People are going to be like why is she?

00:03:48.245 --> 00:03:49.078
Is there something wrong with her back?

00:03:49.078 --> 00:03:49.911
What is she doing?

00:03:49.911 --> 00:03:51.499
Yeah, no, I'm gonna use that.

00:03:51.499 --> 00:03:52.530
- No, no, that booty.

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:53.370
- I love my booty.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:55.200
- [Tyra] That booty being
thick and big and going-

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:56.070
- Oh, I love my booty.

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:57.810
- Like a wine glass on top of it.

00:03:57.810 --> 00:03:58.643
- Yeah.

00:03:58.643 --> 00:04:00.540
- And leaning up and do that, lean down.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.049
- We need relating with booties.

00:04:02.049 --> 00:04:03.480
You know I got a booty over here.

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:04.742
- Yes, you do.

00:04:04.742 --> 00:04:06.140
- Thank you, Tyra.

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:06.973
- No, I love my booty.

00:04:06.973 --> 00:04:08.310
But I'd like to look a
little smaller in pictures.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:11.230
Tyra Banks and Danielle
Nottingham everybody.

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:13.413
(group cheering)

00:04:13.413 --> 00:04:16.950
The Posing Party at ModelLand is open now.

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:19.083
So go online to secure your tickets.

